              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibindi vyose vyabaye ku ngoma ya Ahazi n’ivyerekeye inzira ziwe, uhereye ku ntango ugashika ku mpera, vyanditswe mu gitabu c’abami b’i Buyuda n’Abisirayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahazi arapfa, ahamvya ba sekuruza, ahambwa i Yerusalemu, ariko ntiyashirwa mu mva z’abami ba Isirayeli. Maze umuhungu wiwe Hezekiya amusubirira ku ngoma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
